<PageTitle>The archive: DbnSuite</PageTitle>

<h1>The archive</h1>
<p class="lead">
    A DbnSync archive is plain S3: any S3 client lists and downloads it, and any DBN reader opens its files. Nothing
    needs DbnSync to be running.
</p>

